  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**BODMAS rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ffa26d5dd542291d735e13bceda0e5c6b162b8fcf4320e8d77e67229e1f37849.png] \n\nGiven equation: 63 * 90 * 42 * 230 * 46 * 3 \n\nAfter replacing the *'s by the sequence of mathematical signs in each option, we get:\n\n1. =, ×, +, ÷, – \n\n63 = 90 × 42 + **__230 ÷ 46__** - 3 \n\n63 = __**90 **____**× **____**42**__ + 5 - 3\n\n63 = __**3780 **____**+**____** 5**__ - 3\n\n63 = 3785 - 3\n\n63 ≠ 3782\n\n2. +, ÷, –, =, ×\n\n63 + __**90 **____**÷**____** 42**__ - 230 = 46 × 3\n\n63 + 2.14 - 230 = **__46 × 3__**\n\n**__63 + 2.14__** - 230 = 138\n\n65.14 - 230 = 138\n\n-164.86 ≠ 138\n\n3. =, –, +, ÷, ×\n\n63 = 90 - 42 + **__230 ÷ 46__** × 3\n\n63 = 90 - 42 + **__5__****__ × 3__**\n\n63 = **__90__** - 42 **__+__****__ 15__**\n\n63 = 105 - 42\n\n63 = 63\n\n4. ×, ÷, =, –, +\n\n63 × __**90 ÷ 42**__ = 230 - 46 + 3\n\n__**63 **____**× 2.14**__ = 230 - 46 + 3\n\n134.82 = __**230**__ - 46 __**+**____** 3**__\n\n134.82 = 233 - 46\n\n134.82 ≠ 187\n\nHence, '**=, –, +, ÷, ×**' is the correct answer.",
